{:edb/db-before-t 2604 :edb/db-after-t 2605 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535917 50 #inst "2026-10-15T07:26:10.432Z" 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186129283 1038 #edb/ref 17592186541346 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186129283 1038 #edb/ref 17592186541347 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186129283 1038 #edb/ref 17592186541352 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186129283 1038 #edb/ref 17592186541357 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186129283 1038 #edb/ref 17592186541361 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186129283 1038 #edb/ref 17592186541364 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186129283 1038 #edb/ref 17592186541368 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186129283 1038 #edb/ref 17592186541390 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186129283 1038 #edb/ref 17592186541393 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186129283 1038 #edb/ref 17592186541395 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186129283 1040 #edb/ref 17592186541416 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541346 1068 #edb/ref 17592186541394 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541346 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541346 1071 "Which of the following shows the region in the $uv$-plane where the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v\\end{bmatrix}⟶\\begin{bmatrix}4 u - 12 \\\\ 2 \\left(v + 2\\right)^{2}\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\n\nis (locally) orientation-reversing?" 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541346 1072 #uuid "08434fb0-6532-59e4-bcda-afba09f8c2fa" 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541346 1074 "Recall that a transformation is (locally) orientation-reversing at the points where the Jacobian determinant is negative:\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}<0\n$$\n\nWe have\n\n$$\nT:\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v\\end{bmatrix}⟶\\begin{bmatrix}4 u - 12 \\\\ 2 \\left(v + 2\\right)^{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nComputing the corresponding Jacobian determinant, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} &=\\begin{vmatrix}4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 v + 8\\end{vmatrix} \\\\ &=(4)\\cdot (4 v + 8)-(0)\\cdot (0) \\\\ &=16 v + 32.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the required regions, we solve the following inequality:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}16 v + 32 &<0 \\\\ v < -2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that the equation\n\n$$\nv = -2\n$$\n\ndefines a horizontal line.\n\nTherefore, the region where the transformation is (locally) orientation-reversing must be the following:\n\n![](images/0d/0d6d817325324661cf7b0b3a73a89a8d63558bd90ae268c7598092d5a1354c49.png)" 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541347 1068 #edb/ref 17592186541370 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541347 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541347 1071 "Which of the following shows the region in the $uv$-plane where the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v\\end{bmatrix}⟶\\begin{bmatrix}2 v + \\left(u - 3\\right)^{2} + 4 \\\\ - 3 u - \\left(v + 2\\right)^{2} + 9\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\n\nis (locally) orientation-reversing?" 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541347 1072 #uuid "1669c7a6-5e4f-5ea0-88e1-7712fde23a58" 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541347 1074 "Recall that a transformation is (locally) orientation-reversing at the points where the Jacobian determinant is negative:\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}<0\n$$\n\nWe have\n\n$$\nT:\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v\\end{bmatrix}⟶\\begin{bmatrix}2 v + \\left(u - 3\\right)^{2} + 4 \\\\ - 3 u - \\left(v + 2\\right)^{2} + 9\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nComputing the corresponding Jacobian determinant, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} &=\\begin{vmatrix}2 u - 6 & 2 \\\\ -3 & - 2 v - 4\\end{vmatrix} \\\\ &=(2 u - 6)\\cdot (- 2 v - 4)-(2)\\cdot (-3) \\\\ &=- 4 u v - 8 u + 12 v + 30.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the required regions, we solve the following inequality:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}- 4 u v - 8 u + 12 v + 30 &<0 \\\\ \\left(u - 3\\right) \\left(v + 2\\right) > \\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives the solution $v > -2 + \\frac{3}{2 \\left(u - 3\\right)}$ for $u>3$ and $v < -2 + \\frac{3}{2 \\left(u - 3\\right)}$ for $u<3.$ At $u=3,$ the Jacobian is positive, so this line is excluded from the required region.\n\nNotice that the equation\n\n$$\nv = -2 + \\frac{3}{2 \\left(u - 3\\right)}\n$$\n\ndefines a hyperbola.\n\nTherefore, the region where the transformation is (locally) orientation-reversing must be the following:\n\n![](images/dd/ddaffc1b9c44fc6aa22caac176f1fdd6e171c31e1246d884d25101473977fa9c.png)" 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541348 1080 "images/a1/a14192698baa5f54314d4325bcbc3e9d488ec728b0beee1570921e0869259da3.png" 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541348 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541348 1083 #uuid "1745867c-2de0-5adf-8859-b6656e21d47a" 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541349 1075 #edb/ref 17592186541374 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541349 1075 #edb/ref 17592186541381 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541349 1075 #edb/ref 17592186541382 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541349 1075 #edb/ref 17592186541383 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541349 1075 #edb/ref 17592186541401 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541349 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541349 1077 "selection" 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541349 1078 #edb/ref 17592186541382 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541349 1079 #uuid "18452602-07b3-5f0d-a30a-ee8bb7add6b2" 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541350 1080 "images/89/898fd878de4c411294f1949a767f28c2b5d8b2f8c4f9096b5f78835fd51c31f7.png" 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541350 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541350 1083 #uuid "1e5d9479-126c-53c4-a623-18e52a881365" 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541351 1080 "images/d2/d20afed479d7bf650adc8540ba6f28f9d21243d7017ab3fe0691f5603078575e.png" 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541351 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541351 1083 #uuid "222535a2-4caf-5d24-8c9b-b56cfc089a08" 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541352 1068 #edb/ref 17592186541356 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541352 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541352 1071 "Which of the following shows the region in the $uv$-plane where the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v\\end{bmatrix}⟶\\begin{bmatrix}u + 3 \\\\ \\left(v + 1\\right)^{2}\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\n\nis (locally) orientation-preserving?" 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541352 1072 #uuid "2c2eb638-8c4b-5662-a604-688e503fe711" 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541352 1074 "Recall that a transformation is (locally) orientation-preserving at the points where the Jacobian determinant is positive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}>0\n$$\n\nWe have\n\n$$\nT:\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v\\end{bmatrix}⟶\\begin{bmatrix}u + 3 \\\\ \\left(v + 1\\right)^{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nComputing the corresponding Jacobian determinant, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} &=\\begin{vmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 v + 2\\end{vmatrix} \\\\ &=(1)\\cdot (2 v + 2)-(0)\\cdot (0) \\\\ &=2 v + 2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the required regions, we solve the following inequality:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2 v + 2 &>0 \\\\ v > -1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that the equation\n\n$$\nv = -1\n$$\n\ndefines a horizontal line.\n\nTherefore, the region where the transformation is (locally) orientation-preserving must be the following:\n\n![](images/6b/6bc5057212ab1c347102f5c09aa4d21eb9bb0f6215ed7294be4b30c127e90deb.png)" 13194139535917 17592186045443 true] [17592186541353 1080 "images/53/5358c811168ad9ce8e801e22415864f34b5d694fa50e69aa03c352b7d153cfd5